title: Sometimes agents will get confused about their alias. We should have reminders about who is who whenever we deliver a message (like 'you are <name>. remote agent is <name>'. that's probably not ideal language, so you should improve it.) In general we need concise explicit feedback like this (including instructions like how to reply, which we already do to a degree)
---

Sometimes agents will get confused about their alias. We should have reminders about who is who whenever we deliver a message (like 'you are <name>. remote agent is <name>'. that's probably not ideal language, so you should improve it.) In general we need concise explicit feedback like this (including instructions like how to reply, which we already do to a degree)
